SYSTEM REQUIREMENTS
====================
- Windows 10 or later (64-bit)
- Administrator privileges for installation
- 2GB free disk space
- Internet connection for updates
- Network interface for Suricata monitoring
- PowerShell 5.1+ (PowerShell 7 recommended)

